window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The terrifying Vandar warlords are back—and they want revenge!</b><br> <b>4 Full-length novels. Hours of steamy alien romance.</b></p> <p><i>Prodigal (Book 7):</i> Dark. Deadly. Vengeful. The alien horde that snatches me from my ship is on the hunt for revenge. Their fierce warlord is convinced that forcing me to share his quarters will provoke my cooperation. But he's underestimated my ability to be coerced. I’m determined to escape, even as coercion becomes seduction, and his tortured soul stirs mine.</p> <p><i>Prisoner (Book 8):</i> I’m eager to join my fellow resistance fighters when they team up with the Vandar hordes, but working on the Vandar ship means I’m colleagues with the tough aliens and answer to the new warlord, Raas Aydan. I’m used to the Vandar being scary, but the Lost Vandar are different, and I’ve never had a man look at me the way the warlord does.</p> <p><i>Protector (Book 9): </i>I thought the cocky Vandar raiders I had to work alongside were my biggest problem. That was before the deranged leader of a ruthless band of mercenaries decided I belonged to him. But now my biggest problem isn’t the alien searching for me, it’s the Vandar battle chief assigned to take me to safety, and who expects me to obey him. Can Kaiven save me from the alien outlaw who’s determined to make me his queen?</p> <p><i>Prince (Book 10):</i> I was safe hiding on the outskirts of the galaxy until the menacing alien prince with the platinum hair and claiming gaze bought my debt. Despite the prince’s promise to protect me, he has no idea what he’s set in motion by plucking me from obscurity. As we get closer to him exacting his revenge, I’m in danger of being taken by someone even more deadly.<br> <br> This collection of four full-length sci-fi romance novels contains lots of HEAs and no cheating. It features steamy scenes on raider warships, kickass heroines,and some serious enemies-to-lovers and abduction to seduction heat.</p>"; 
